Field 0 Variables                                                                       bts6120.plx


1475    00051        	SIMFLG:	.BLOCK	1	; non-zero if we're executing a single instruction
1476    00052        	SAVCHR:	.BLOCK	1	; a place to save a character
1477                 	
1478                 	; Terminal parameters...
1479    00053        	CTRLO:	.BLOCK	1	; non-zero if output is supressed
