6411                 		.TITLE	Return from Routines in Field 1
6412                 	
6413                 	
6414                 	;   This routine is the other half of the code at PUSHJ1:, and it allows
6415                 	; routines in field one which were called from field zero to return to
6416                 	; field zero.  It only needs to do two instructions, but those instructions
6417                 	; have to be somewhere in field one!
6418    10306    6203	POPJ1:	CXF	0		; return to field zero
